{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10018","headline":"送部四镇人往单于别知故 · 徐九臯","name":"送部四镇人往单于别知故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天下今无事，云中独未宁。\n忝驱更戍卒，方远送边庭。\n马饮长城水，军占太白星。\n国恩行可报，何必守经营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐九臯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}